{"issues":[{"expand":"renderedFields,names,schema,operations,editmeta,changelog,versionedRepresentations","id":"109479","self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/109479","key":"MC-236783","renderedFields":{"summary":null,"issuetype":null,"watches":null,"customfield_10070":null,"customfield_10061":"","created":"16/Sep/21 1:12 AM","customfield_10050":"","customfield_10051":null,"description":"<p>In new snapshots illagers will ignore baby villagers like BE, but ravagers still attack baby villagers.</p>\n\n<h3><a name=\"StepstoReproduce%3A\"></a>Steps to Reproduce:</h3>\n<ul>\n\t<li>Summon a ravager and a baby villager.\n<div class=\"preformatted panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"preformattedContent panelContent\">\n<pre> /summon minecraft:ravager ~ ~ ~\n /summon minecraft:villager ~ ~ ~ {Age:-25000}\n</pre>\n</div></div></li>\n\t<li>Wait a couple of seconds.<br>\n<img class=\"emoticon\" src=\"/images/icons/emoticons/error.png\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" align=\"absmiddle\" alt=\"\" border=\"0\"> →  Notice how ravagers are able to attack baby villagers.</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<h3><a name=\"ExpectedBehavior%3A\"></a>Expected Behavior:</h3>\n\n<p>The expected behavior would be that ravagers are not able to attack baby villagers, just like how they can't in Bedrock Edition.*</p>","customfield_10054":null,"fixVersions":null,"customfield_10055":null,"resolution":null,"customfield_10047":"18/Sep/21 5:27 AM","customfield_10048":null,"labels":null,"customfield_10049":null,"attachment":[{"self":"https://mojira.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/attachment/144483","id":"144483","filename":"2021-09-16_16.07.59.png","author":{"avatarUrls":{"48x48":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FM-5.png","24x24":"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/d70168bc4d0c82762f0a18f8b5637505?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Fi